Package: lmpackage
Type: Package
Title: Simulate the linear regression lm function in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Samantha", "Figueredo Botello",
      email = "sfiguere@umich.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Fits linear regression models by solving the normal
    equations directly. Method uses ordinary least squares implementation.
    Returns and reports results in the same style as 'lm' and 'summary.lm' 
    in base R linear regression function. 
